{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1068,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1876143,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1413723307,"LastPoster":{"Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":1877441,"PostDate":1414760931,"PostContent":"\u00a0 St. Lucia is absolutely beautiful.. I have looked into mexico but the MIL wasn't thrilled abou...","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411411687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.239.174","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78240,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by amandankeith, 19 October 2014 - 04:58 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1413723522,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a84efda94da6a52f4f2bf828f150853a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I requested information from Coconut Bay Resort regaurding their wedding rates for 2016. I figured I would share.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;2014-2016\n\nWeddings, Honeymoons &amp;amp;\n\nVow Renewals&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:right;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; Choose from several customized packages offering&amp;nbsp; enchanting\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t settings for your perfect day or ask your personal wedding\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; consultant about the elegant options available to make your\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; ceremony an affair to remember.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deluxe Wedding Package&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n$725d or FREE** for up to four guests\n\n$12 per person for each additional guest.\n\n\u2022 Decorated wedding location: Oceanfront Gazebo\n\n\u2022 Bridal bouquet\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for groom\n\n\u2022 One tier wedding cake\n\n\u2022 Chilled bottle of sparkling wine\n\n\u2022 Personal wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 One (1) 5 x 7 wedding photograph with frame\n\n\u2022 Marriage Officer\n\n\u2022 Government &amp;amp; administrative fees\n\n\u2022 Copy of marriage license\n\n\u2022 Witnesses (if required)\n\n\u2022 Guaranteed Dinner reservations for wedding party (up to four)\n\n** with 7 nights in HARMONY Jr. Suite Ocean-View or 7 nights in SPLASH 2BR\n\nFamily Connecting - FREE wedding cannot be combined with any other sale or\n\npromotion. Resort credits may not be applied in combination with FREE\n\nwedding packages. FREE weddings are conducted Monday through\n\nWednesday AT 10am OR 1pm ONLY except holidays and special\n\noccasion dates.\n&lt;strong&gt;For Gold packages and above, couples may choose from wedding\n\nceremonies performed on the beach or in our oceanfront gazebo.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gold Wedding Package&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n$1750 d for up to ten guests.\n\n$65 per person for each additional guest.\n\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:\n\n\u2022 Two (2) tier wedding cake\n\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party\n\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*\n\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night\n\nincluding sparkling wine\n\n\u2022 DJ for one hour\n\n\u2022 Bride\u2019s hairstyling &amp;amp; make up application for ceremony\n\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception &amp;amp; Standard bar**\n\n\u2022 FREE night on 1st anniversary trip back*&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diamond Wedding Package&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n$2445 d for up to sixteen guests.\n\n$70 per person for each additional guest.\n\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:\n\n\u2022 Two (2) tier wedding cake\n\n\u2022 Decorated reception area including 2 floral table centerpieces\n\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party\n\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*\n\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night\n\nincluding sparkling wine\n\n\u2022 DJ for two hours\n\n\u2022 Bride\u2019s hair styling &amp;amp; make-up application for the ceremony\n\n\u2022 Mini-manicure and mini-pedicure for the bride\n\n\u2022 1\/2 day Private Island Tour for two\n\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception &amp;amp; Standard bar**\n\n\u2022 FREE night on 1st anniversary trip back*&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platinum Wedding Package&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n$3575 d for up to twenty guests.\n\n$85 per person for each additional guest.\n\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:\n\n\u2022 Upgraded bridal bouquet\n\n\u2022 Three (3) tier wedding cake\n\n\u2022 Decorated reception area including 4 floral table centerpieces\n\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party\n\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*\n\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night\n\nincluding sparkling wine\n\n\u2022 Live Steel Band for one hour\n\n\u2022 Bridal Bliss Spa package includes: Hydralift eye care facial,\n\nmanicure, wedding hairstyle, makeup consultation and application.\n\n\u2022 50 minute couples Tranquility massage\n\n\u2022 1\/2 day Private Island Tour for two\n\n\u2022 Two-hour private horseback riding tour for two\n\n\u2022 One (1) hour cocktail reception with hors d\u2019 oeuvres\n\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception &amp;amp; Standard bar**\n\n\u2022 TWO (2) FREE nights on 1st anniversary trip back*&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Continental breakfast in bed limited to one (1) morning during stay.\n\nFree anniversary night will be offered in same room category as\n\noriginal booking with a 7 night minimum stay during your wedding. To\n\nbe eligible for free anniversary nights, guests must stay within one\n\nmonth of their actual anniversary date. Copy of marriage certificate is\n\nrequired upon arrival. Dinner Receptions incur additional charges after\n\n3 hours or after 9 pm. There is no credit\/refund for unused package\n\ninclusions.\n\n** Guests may choose to upgrade to a Premium or Platinum Bar for a\n\nnominal per person fee.\n\nd Rates indicated do not include St. Lucia VAT Sales tax and service\n\ncharges will apply for any food and beverage add ons or upgrades.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have more information but it might overload this post. If you have any questions just message and I will see if I have the answers for you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Amanda&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876143,"PostDate":1413723307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I requested information from Coconut Bay Resort regaurding their wedding rates for 2016. I figured I would share.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><u>2014-2016<br>\nWeddings, Honeymoons &<br>\nVow Renewals<\/u><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>Wedding Packages<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Choose from several customized packages offering\u00a0 enchanting<br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 settings for your perfect day or ask your personal wedding<br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 consultant about the elegant options available to make your<br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ceremony an affair to remember.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Deluxe Wedding Package<\/strong><br>\n$725d or FREE** for up to four guests<br>\n$12 per person for each additional guest.<br>\n\u2022 Decorated wedding location: Oceanfront Gazebo<br>\n\u2022 Bridal bouquet<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for groom<br>\n\u2022 One tier wedding cake<br>\n\u2022 Chilled bottle of sparkling wine<br>\n\u2022 Personal wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 One (1) 5 x 7 wedding photograph with frame<br>\n\u2022 Marriage Officer<br>\n\u2022 Government & administrative fees<br>\n\u2022 Copy of marriage license<br>\n\u2022 Witnesses (if required)<br>\n\u2022 Guaranteed Dinner reservations for wedding party (up to four)<br>\n** with 7 nights in HARMONY Jr. Suite Ocean-View or 7 nights in SPLASH 2BR<br>\nFamily Connecting - FREE wedding cannot be combined with any other sale or<br>\npromotion. Resort credits may not be applied in combination with FREE<br>\nwedding packages. FREE weddings are conducted Monday through<br>\nWednesday AT 10am OR 1pm ONLY except holidays and special<br>\noccasion dates.<br><strong>For Gold packages and above, couples may choose from wedding<br>\nceremonies performed on the beach or in our oceanfront gazebo.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Gold Wedding Package<\/strong><br>\n$1750 d for up to ten guests.<br>\n$65 per person for each additional guest.<br>\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:<br>\n\u2022 Two (2) tier wedding cake<br>\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party<br>\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*<br>\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night<br>\nincluding sparkling wine<br>\n\u2022 DJ for one hour<br>\n\u2022 Bride\u2019s hairstyling & make up application for ceremony<br>\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception & Standard bar**<br>\n\u2022 FREE night on 1st anniversary trip back*<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Diamond Wedding Package<\/strong><br>\n$2445 d for up to sixteen guests.<br>\n$70 per person for each additional guest.<br>\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:<br>\n\u2022 Two (2) tier wedding cake<br>\n\u2022 Decorated reception area including 2 floral table centerpieces<br>\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party<br>\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*<br>\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night<br>\nincluding sparkling wine<br>\n\u2022 DJ for two hours<br>\n\u2022 Bride\u2019s hair styling & make-up application for the ceremony<br>\n\u2022 Mini-manicure and mini-pedicure for the bride<br>\n\u2022 1\/2 day Private Island Tour for two<br>\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception & Standard bar**<br>\n\u2022 FREE night on 1st anniversary trip back*<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Platinum Wedding Package<\/strong><br>\n$3575 d for up to twenty guests.<br>\n$85 per person for each additional guest.<br>\nIncludes all amenities from DELUXE package PLUS:<br>\n\u2022 Upgraded bridal bouquet<br>\n\u2022 Three (3) tier wedding cake<br>\n\u2022 Decorated reception area including 4 floral table centerpieces<br>\n\u2022 15% off spa services for members of the bridal party<br>\n\u2022 Continental Breakfast in Bed*<br>\n\u2022 Romance turndown service on wedding night<br>\nincluding sparkling wine<br>\n\u2022 Live Steel Band for one hour<br>\n\u2022 Bridal Bliss Spa package includes: Hydralift eye care facial,<br>\nmanicure, wedding hairstyle, makeup consultation and application.<br>\n\u2022 50 minute couples Tranquility massage<br>\n\u2022 1\/2 day Private Island Tour for two<br>\n\u2022 Two-hour private horseback riding tour for two<br>\n\u2022 One (1) hour cocktail reception with hors d\u2019 oeuvres<br>\n\u2022 Three course private dinner reception & Standard bar**<br>\n\u2022 TWO (2) FREE nights on 1st anniversary trip back*<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>*Continental breakfast in bed limited to one (1) morning during stay.<br>\nFree anniversary night will be offered in same room category as<br>\noriginal booking with a 7 night minimum stay during your wedding. To<br>\nbe eligible for free anniversary nights, guests must stay within one<br>\nmonth of their actual anniversary date. Copy of marriage certificate is<br>\nrequired upon arrival. Dinner Receptions incur additional charges after<br>\n3 hours or after 9 pm. There is no credit\/refund for unused package<br>\ninclusions.<br>\n** Guests may choose to upgrade to a Premium or Platinum Bar for a<br>\nnominal per person fee.<br>\nd Rates indicated do not include St. Lucia VAT Sales tax and service<br>\ncharges will apply for any food and beverage add ons or upgrades.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have more information but it might overload this post. If you have any questions just message and I will see if I have the answers for you.<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Amanda<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411411687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78240,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16da83df8c20847ad6b1785ef4c60e88","RawContent":"Great info! Was just looking at this resort today for possible wedding there I&#039;m all over the place looking at Mexico and st Lucia lol. But the ceremony locations and the beach at this resort just looks amazing \n\n\nWhich package did you choose?\n\nDo you know where the private dinner locations are?\n\nI saw the packages on their wedding website but didn&#039;t know how many people it included so thanks for this post!","Attachments":[],"Id":1877271,"PostDate":1414615039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great info! Was just looking at this resort today for possible wedding there I'm all over the place looking at Mexico and st Lucia lol. But the ceremony locations and the beach at this resort just looks amazing <br><br>\nWhich package did you choose?<br>\nDo you know where the private dinner locations are?<br>\nI saw the packages on their wedding website but didn't know how many people it included so thanks for this post!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412308287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.238.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78240,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb81e9bfffb3086f23c5f2f02f427471","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kimmyd2\" post=\"1877271\" timestamp=\"1414611439\"]\nGreat info! Was just looking at this resort today for possible wedding there I&#039;m all over the place looking at Mexico and st Lucia lol. But the ceremony locations and the beach at this resort just looks amazing\n\nWhich package did you choose?\nDo you know where the private dinner locations are?\nI saw the packages on their wedding website but didn&#039;t know how many people it included so thanks for this post![\/quote]\nSt. Lucia is absolutely beautiful.. I have looked into mexico but the MIL wasn&#039;t thrilled about mexico so we decided on St.Lucia. We have only discussed the packages and it seems like we are leaning towards the platinum package with a few things from the Diamond.\nAs far as the locations the lady at the resort hasn;t sent me any information like that as we haven&#039;t book however she did send me the facebook that she uses and has pictures of wedding on there. here is the [url=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Sarai-Coconut-Bay-Wedding-Planner\/499421250135103?ref=br_tf\"]link [\/url]Hope this helps and any other information I obtain I will share with you.\n\nGood luck and Happy Planning! :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1877441,"PostDate":1414760931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kimmyd2, on 29 October 2014 - 12:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Great info! Was just looking at this resort today for possible wedding there I'm all over the place looking at Mexico and st Lucia lol. But the ceremony locations and the beach at this resort just looks amazing<br><br>\nWhich package did you choose?<br>\nDo you know where the private dinner locations are?<br>\nI saw the packages on their wedding website but didn't know how many people it included so thanks for this post!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>St. Lucia is absolutely beautiful.. I have looked into mexico but the MIL wasn't thrilled about mexico so we decided on St.Lucia. We have only discussed the packages and it seems like we are leaning towards the platinum package with a few things from the Diamond.<\/p>\n<p>As far as the locations the lady at the resort hasn;t sent me any information like that as we haven't book however she did send me the facebook that she uses and has pictures of wedding on there. here is the <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Sarai-Coconut-Bay-Wedding-Planner\/499421250135103?ref=br_tf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>link<\/a>Hope this helps and any other information I obtain I will share with you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and Happy Planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411411687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78240","Title":"Coconut Bay Resort Wedding Rates 2014-2016","LastPostDate":1414760931},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
