ng if there are brides out there that planned the wedding themselves without using a wedding planner?  If you had to do it over again, would you hire a wedding planner for the price around $3,000 that could go toward photography or flowers?\n\n\nI&#039;m debating to whether or not to hire a wedding planner.\n\n\nThank you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1856424,"PostDate":1403334541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All,<br><br>\nI'm planning to get married on Grace Bay in April next year and I'm wondering if there are brides out there that planned the wedding themselves without using a wedding planner?  If you had to do it over again, would you hire a wedding planner for the price around $3,000 that could go toward photography or flowers?<br><br>\nI'm debating to whether or not to hire a wedding planner.<br><br>\nThank you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"apattanasiri@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.14.253.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403333927,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FromLV","Id":278625,"Name":"FromLV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"78.129.250.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78d34a7083a5ccd9e43887e72c3f2f87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Grace Bay is a fantastic place, surely you will enjoy but i advice you to hire a wedding planner so that you can enjoy your wedding ceremony otherwise it will become stressful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Because there are certain things like arrangement, food , decoration, most importantly guest,so if you hire them then they will take care of all the arrangements.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856428,"PostDate":1403353824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Grace Bay is a fantastic place, surely you will enjoy but i advice you to hire a wedding planner so that you can enjoy your wedding ceremony otherwise it will become stressful.<\/p>\n<p>Because there are certain things like arrangement, food , decoration, most importantly guest,so if you hire them then they will take care of all the arrangements.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"raiden1313clark@gmail.com","IpAddress":"193.150.8.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403338580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Qiana1Parker","Id":278626,"Name":"Qiana1Parker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.203.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a76cc9df22a7aa2d399433d4550b392","RawContent":"Omg Grace Bay looks amazing!! I&#039;ve been eyeing it down.\n\nWe are waiting for a quote from our travel agent!!\n\nGood luck !","Attachments":[],"Id":1856496,"PostDate":1403457076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Omg Grace Bay looks amazing!! I've been eyeing it down.<br>\nWe are waiting for a quote from our travel agent!!<br>\nGood luck !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397906214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.54.45.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2475386cde8559a918fd70d6e795516f","RawContent":"So pretty! Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1861254,"PostDate":1405965583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So pretty! Good luck! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bseasebey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"69.117.93.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402065568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SuchALady777","Id":278273,"Name":"SuchALady777","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.178.240.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52db49ae19f18148a31aaf79a25052ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and welcome!!&amp;nbsp; I say read all the reviews on here... I recommend all of our clients hire a planner as they make all the difference in the world and usually end up paying for themselves at a minimum in what they save you when hiring other vendors.&amp;nbsp; They have relationships and save you what could be a nightmare with flaky vendors.&amp;nbsp; We have worked all over Playa Del Carmen, Bahamas and Jamaica, there are definitely things to look out for and research. Feel free to ask us any quesions as we have been in the business for 8 years and can give you insight as to what the norm is - rates - what to avoid - and what questions to ask your photographer :)&amp;nbsp; Happy to help!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you,\n\n\nJanel Conlan\n\nFocus Photography, Inc.\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com\/blog&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com\/blog&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nP: 949.342.4443 F: 949.272.5147\n\n\nSee us featured in:&amp;nbsp; Grace Ormonde, Ceremony, Style Me Pretty, and Green Wedding Shoes!\n\n\nBecome a Fan!&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/focusphotoinc&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/focusphotoinc&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nFollow Us!&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/twitter.com\/#!\/focusphotoinc&#039;&gt;http:\/\/twitter.com\/#!\/focusphotoinc&lt;\/a&gt;\n\nPin Us! &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/focusphotoinc\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/focusphotoinc\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868171,"PostDate":1408687895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and welcome!!\u00a0 I say read all the reviews on here... I recommend all of our clients hire a planner as they make all the difference in the world and usually end up paying for themselves at a minimum in what they save you when hiring other vendors.\u00a0 They have relationships and save you what could be a nightmare with flaky vendors.\u00a0 We have worked all over Playa Del Carmen, Bahamas and Jamaica, there are definitely things to look out for and research. Feel free to ask us any quesions as we have been in the business for 8 years and can give you insight as to what the norm is - rates - what to avoid - and what questions to ask your photographer <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Happy to help!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you,<br><br>\nJanel Conlan<br>\nFocus Photography, Inc.<br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com<\/a><br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com\/blog' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.focusphotoinc.com\/blog<\/a><br>\nP: 949.342.4443 F: 949.272.5147<br><br>\nSee us featured in:\u00a0 Grace Ormonde, Ceremony, Style Me Pretty, and Green Wedding Shoes!<br><br>\nBecome a Fan!\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/focusphotoinc' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/focusphotoinc<\/a><br>\nFollow Us!\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/twitter.com\/#!\/focusphotoinc' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/twitter.com\/#!\/focusphotoinc<\/a><br>\nPin Us! <a href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/focusphotoinc\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.pinterest...\/focusphotoinc\/<\/a><br><br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janel@focusphotoinc.com","IpAddress":"98.178.240.147","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1220273100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211497.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"focusphoto","Id":211497,"Name":"focusphoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77374","Title":"Wedding In Turks And Caicos Without A Wedding Planner","LastPostDate":1408687895},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-