rrible at making decisions which has made it extremely difficult for me to choose a dress and I only have 9 months until my wedding day. I have narrowed it down to two dresses, but am having a tough time picking one as I love them both :wacko:. I am leaning towards the dress with the fuller ruffled skirt as I think it will look beautiful on the beach and I love the lace detailing. But, I love the other one too. I think it may be more flattering on me&amp;nbsp;the material is&amp;nbsp;much lighter which will be more comfortable in the heat. I am wondering if it is too plain for my personality though. I have asked a few friends and they all have different opinions which makes it even harder! I would love some input and any advice you may have so I can make a decision soon!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;The pictures are so small and I don&#039;t know how to make them larger :huh:?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32040,"Name":"Dress number 1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-46304500-1430965357.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-46304500-1430965357_thumb.jpg","Width":89,"Height":158},{"Id":32041,"Name":"Dress Number2.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-57920400-1430965367.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282027-0-57920400-1430965367_thumb.png","Width":89,"Height":160}],"Id":1895585,"PostDate":1430966040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am terrible at making decisions which has made it extremely difficult for me to choose a dress and I only have 9 months until my wedding day. I have narrowed it down to two dresses, but am having a tough time picking one as I love them both <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>. I am leaning towards the dress with the fuller ruffled skirt as I think it will look beautiful on the beach and I love the lace detailing. But, I love the other one too. I think it may be more flattering on me\u00a0the material is\u00a0much lighter which will be more comfortable in the heat. I am wondering if it is too plain for my personality though. I have asked a few friends and they all have different opinions which makes it even harder! I would love some input and any advice you may have so I can make a decision soon!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much<\/p>\n<br \/><p>The pictures are so small and I don't know how to make them larger <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/huh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':huh:' \/>?!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.76.188","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","Delet